{"4205900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mining Wizards", "steam_appid": 4205900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4481690], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mining Wizards is a simple idle incremental game. Mine massive amounts of minerals and strengthen your magic as you progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;&lt; Mine Minerals! &gt;&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move the mining area to cover minerals and automatically mine them. The Core Orb fires magical projectiles to carry out the mining.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205900/extras/21c83806f99f210991c511f33d5e1418.poster.avif?t=1774895725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205900/extras/21c83806f99f210991c511f33d5e1418.webm?t=1774895725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205900/extras/21c83806f99f210991c511f33d5e1418.mp4?t=1774895725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;&lt; Gather Resources! &gt;&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mined minerals drop elements, which can be crafted into crystals. You can obtain various elements from different minerals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205900/extras/178a853e84385d5194acbef1f888b7ed.poster.avif?t=1774895725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205900/extras/178a853e84385d5194acbef1f888b7ed.webm?t=1774895725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205900/extras/178a853e84385d5194acbef1f888b7ed.mp4?t=1774895725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;&lt; Massive Skill Tree! &gt;&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your skill tree using crystals. The stronger your mining power becomes, the more resources you can gather.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205900/extras/42f550eadca999f0610836f4dfac0c44.poster.avif?t=1774895725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205900/extras/42f550eadca999f0610836f4dfac0c44.webm?t=1774895725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205900/extras/42f550eadca999f0610836f4dfac0c44.mp4?t=1774895725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;&lt; Unlock Talents! &gt;&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up to gain mana and unlock talents. Talents further boost your mining abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205900/extras/5c3d8f42845d09060ef80782b1d19b79.poster.avif?t=1774895725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205900/extras/5c3d8f42845d09060ef80782b1d19b79.webm?t=1774895725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205900/extras/5c3d8f42845d09060ef80782b1d19b79.mp4?t=1774895725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;&lt; Discover Artifacts! &gt;&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine artifacts to further increase your mining power and attract more visitors. Artifact visitors generate idle crystals even while you're away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205900/extras/fccf3c0efdba5f13763b20394110683a.poster.avif?t=1774895725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205900/extras/fccf3c0efdba5f13763b20394110683a.webm?t=1774895725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205900/extras/fccf3c0efdba5f13763b20394110683a.mp4?t=1774895725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ Orbs with unique magic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300+ Skill tree nodes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ Talents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >90+ Artifacts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 Achievements</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mining Wizards is a simple idle incremental game. Mine massive amounts of minerals and strengthen your magic as you progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;&lt; Mine Minerals! &gt;&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move the mining area to cover minerals and automatically mine them. The Core Orb fires magical projectiles to carry out the mining.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205900/extras/21c83806f99f210991c511f33d5e1418.poster.avif?t=1774895725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205900/extras/21c83806f99f210991c511f33d5e1418.webm?t=1774895725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205900/extras/21c83806f99f210991c511f33d5e1418.mp4?t=1774895725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;&lt; Gather Resources! &gt;&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mined minerals drop elements, which can be crafted into crystals. You can obtain various elements from different minerals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205900/extras/178a853e84385d5194acbef1f888b7ed.poster.avif?t=1774895725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205900/extras/178a853e84385d5194acbef1f888b7ed.webm?t=1774895725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205900/extras/178a853e84385d5194acbef1f888b7ed.mp4?t=1774895725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;&lt; Massive Skill Tree! &gt;&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your skill tree using crystals. The stronger your mining power becomes, the more resources you can gather.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205900/extras/42f550eadca999f0610836f4dfac0c44.poster.avif?t=1774895725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205900/extras/42f550eadca999f0610836f4dfac0c44.webm?t=1774895725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205900/extras/42f550eadca999f0610836f4dfac0c44.mp4?t=1774895725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;&lt; Unlock Talents! &gt;&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up to gain mana and unlock talents. Talents further boost your mining abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205900/extras/5c3d8f42845d09060ef80782b1d19b79.poster.avif?t=1774895725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205900/extras/5c3d8f42845d09060ef80782b1d19b79.webm?t=1774895725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205900/extras/5c3d8f42845d09060ef80782b1d19b79.mp4?t=1774895725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;&lt; Discover Artifacts! &gt;&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine artifacts to further increase your mining power and attract more visitors. Artifact visitors generate idle crystals even while you're away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205900/extras/fccf3c0efdba5f13763b20394110683a.poster.avif?t=1774895725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205900/extras/fccf3c0efdba5f13763b20394110683a.webm?t=1774895725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205900/extras/fccf3c0efdba5f13763b20394110683a.mp4?t=1774895725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ Orbs with unique magic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300+ Skill tree nodes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ Talents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >90+ Artifacts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 Achievements</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Mining Wizards is an incremental mining game. Mine minerals, gather materials, upgrade a massive skill tree, level up, unlock talents, discover artifacts, and attract artifact visitors!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Thai, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205900/1e008d257aaf34b11f654c93fb17592dbb22d8f3/header.jpg?t=1774895725", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205900/3a0b9c69c1d7f4fd38bce81be6dacd3f4b02cbec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774895725", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205900/3a0b9c69c1d7f4fd38bce81be6dacd3f4b02cbec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774895725", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX960 / AMD Radeon RX560 Series / Intel HD Graphics 4600<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 700 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommende